==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 2~8 seconds<sup>60f~240f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 2~9.33 seconds<sup>60f~280f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 0.07~10.67 seconds<sup>2f~320f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 10~33.33 seconds<sup>300f~1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 4~12.67 seconds<sup>120f~380f</sup>.
*Infinite [[One Horn]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 33.33~60 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns as the boss after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 0.67~8 seconds<sup>20f~240f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Your standard arsenal of [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Reds]] will make short work of this stage.

